WEBVTT

01:35.950 --> 01:37.860
Welcome.

01:42.240 --> 01:44.040
Why are you just standing there?

01:44.040 --> 01:47.290
Oh, it's nothing... DŌMO, Maname-SAN.

01:51.670 --> 01:54.550
So are you really interested in joining the movement?

01:54.550 --> 01:58.180
Yes, but I've never been part of a movement before.

01:58.180 --> 02:00.180
There's a lot I don't know.

02:00.180 --> 02:03.140
Should I take a JUTTE or BŌ or something?

02:00.180 --> 02:03.140
NOTE: The BŌ is a proud, honorable NINJA STICK.

02:04.310 --> 02:05.220
Sorry.

02:05.220 --> 02:09.350
Naraki-SAN, our war isn't about terrorism.

02:09.350 --> 02:12.520
If we march with weapons,
the cops will grab us immediately.

02:12.520 --> 02:14.280
We won't win the support of the people, either.

02:14.280 --> 02:16.280
So that gets us nowhere, right?

02:16.280 --> 02:20.110
And now a report on the protest at Marunouchi SUGOI Tall Building.

02:20.570 --> 02:25.500
A citizen group met at the
Marunouchi SUGOI Tall Building

02:25.500 --> 02:28.620
to protest the government's new funding of the Kanamana Fundamental Corporation.

02:28.620 --> 02:31.330
That's the protest from last week, right?

02:31.330 --> 02:36.340
Yes. More people like you are joining all the time.

02:36.340 --> 02:39.550
Still, it feels like you got
enthusiastic really quickly.

02:39.550 --> 02:43.050
Yeah. I've had my conscious...
My consciousness has been raised!

02:43.050 --> 02:45.600
I see! That's great.

02:47.810 --> 02:51.150
I've got things to do before the protest, so I have to go.

02:51.150 --> 02:53.650
Okay, see you later.

02:53.650 --> 02:56.440
Yeah... If I can.

02:59.990 --> 03:04.870
Draw out the power of your
NINJA SOUL the right way, Fujikido-SAN!

03:04.870 --> 03:06.620
This is farewell!

03:06.620 --> 03:09.460
Do not forget my teachings!

03:10.210 --> 03:12.170
And take care of Yukano for me!

03:12.540 --> 03:17.300
IKKI UCHIKOWASHI... Now I have seen its true nature.

03:17.550 --> 03:20.590
You dare betray us?

03:20.590 --> 03:22.050
How foolish!

03:22.050 --> 03:24.930
Take care of Yukano for me!

03:24.930 --> 03:26.220
Take care of Yukano...

03:27.930 --> 03:31.730
<i>Yukano is now in a situation she would surely find intolerable.</i>

03:31.730 --> 03:35.110
She's lost her memories, and IKKI UCHIKOWASHI
is taking advantage of her.

03:35.400 --> 03:41.950
<i>I must face Yukano, the girl who now calls herself AMNESIA, once more!</i>

03:44.200 --> 03:55.040
No poverty! No poverty! No poverty!

03:44.200 --> 03:47.030
The goal of this march is Marunouchi,

03:47.030 --> 03:51.370
where the offices of the
KACHIGUMI salarymen are located.

03:51.370 --> 03:55.040
At the end of the march, they will surround the Marunouchi SUGOI Tall Building.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.790
There's so many people.

03:56.790 --> 03:58.500
Where's Maname-SAN?

03:59.090 --> 04:00.050
What's wrong?

04:00.050 --> 04:01.380
AIYEARGH!

04:01.380 --> 04:03.680
DŌMO. What's your name?

04:03.680 --> 04:04.550
Where'd you come from?

04:04.550 --> 04:06.930
DŌMO. I'm Naraki.

04:06.930 --> 04:08.930
I go to Neo-Saitama University #1.

04:08.930 --> 04:11.600
Hey, that's my Alma mater!

04:11.600 --> 04:14.100
I haven't found a job since I graduated, though.

04:14.100 --> 04:15.730
Why'd you come to a protest?

04:15.730 --> 04:17.980
You're not here for politics, are you?

04:17.980 --> 04:19.400
A girlfriend, maybe?

04:19.900 --> 04:22.740
To be honest, that was part of it.

04:22.740 --> 04:24.280
I'll admit that.

04:25.820 --> 04:26.660
I was right.

04:27.120 --> 04:28.240
It's not like that!

04:28.240 --> 04:30.410
At first that was all it was,

04:30.410 --> 04:35.580
but now that I'm marching with everyone,
I'm happy my consciousness was raised.

04:35.580 --> 04:36.500
Hmm?

04:36.790 --> 04:38.460
It's true!

04:38.460 --> 04:38.960
I—

04:38.960 --> 04:41.420
I don't doubt you.

04:41.880 --> 04:43.510
But what do you really think?

04:43.510 --> 04:46.180
Is a march really going to change anything?

04:46.180 --> 04:47.140
Huh?

04:56.690 --> 04:59.320
You ever seen an old zombie flick?

04:59.320 --> 05:01.150
Not those new ones that they run.

05:01.150 --> 05:04.150
The ones with authentic, slow,
staggering zombies.

05:04.150 --> 05:06.280
Y-Yeah...

05:06.570 --> 05:09.780
A single zombie is slow and weak.

05:09.780 --> 05:13.910
So the survivors can deal with them once they've gotten used to it.

05:14.250 --> 05:18.420
They can seal off a shopping mall and live a life of luxury inside.

05:18.420 --> 05:20.420
What are you talking about?

05:20.420 --> 05:23.010
It's a METAPHOR, man. A METAPHOR.

05:20.420 --> 05:23.010
NOTE: A METAPHOR is like a SIMILE.

05:23.010 --> 05:25.720
But if one little thing goes wrong,

05:25.720 --> 05:29.760
the once-powerless zombies can break down the barricade and swarm inside.

05:29.760 --> 05:31.850
And once that happens, it's too late.

05:31.850 --> 05:34.390
There aren't any safe places left.

05:34.720 --> 05:37.560
What are you doing at this march?

05:37.900 --> 05:40.520
Why am I here? Let me see...

05:40.520 --> 05:42.610
Shut up!

05:42.860 --> 05:46.200
You goddamn students come here every week!

05:46.200 --> 05:49.200
You guys don't have bills to pay!
So you should pay us!

05:49.200 --> 05:51.830
Screw you, assholes! Capitalist slaves!

05:51.830 --> 05:53.910
You defeatists should be ashamed!

05:53.910 --> 05:56.460
The conflict's begun.

05:56.460 --> 05:58.790
And each of them has a point, don't they?

05:58.790 --> 06:00.420
This is what happens.

06:04.420 --> 06:06.340
The cops are going to arrest me?

06:06.340 --> 06:07.380
Maybe.

06:07.380 --> 06:08.130
Why?

06:08.130 --> 06:09.550
Why wouldn't they?

06:09.550 --> 06:11.100
No...

06:19.690 --> 06:20.980
Maname-SAN!

06:21.310 --> 06:22.820
Screw you, asshole!

06:22.820 --> 06:23.860
Fuck off and die!

06:23.860 --> 06:24.520
Lemme through!

06:24.520 --> 06:25.820
No poverty!

06:25.820 --> 06:26.740
Let me through!

06:32.120 --> 06:33.620
YEEART!

06:32.370 --> 06:33.620
GWARGH!

06:37.330 --> 06:38.460
He's dead!

06:38.460 --> 06:39.870
The cops shot a student!

06:42.540 --> 06:43.880
Maname-SAN?

06:44.550 --> 06:45.420
Why?

06:45.420 --> 06:47.920
This is that little thing.

06:48.510 --> 06:50.970
Why? What are you—

06:50.970 --> 06:53.260
I am you.

06:53.260 --> 06:55.010
And everyone is me.

06:55.010 --> 06:58.640
Everyone is a revolutionary warrior for IKKI UCHIKOWASHI.

06:59.020 --> 07:01.100
IKKI UCHIKOWASHI?

07:01.100 --> 07:02.270
That's right.

07:02.270 --> 07:03.440
What's your name?

07:06.230 --> 07:09.780
My name is Tetsuo.

07:11.530 --> 07:18.040
Naraki realizes that some people in the crowd are deliberately attacking the police!

07:18.040 --> 07:19.540
Arrest them!

07:19.830 --> 07:21.420
I didn't do anything!

07:21.710 --> 07:24.340
No back-talk!

07:24.340 --> 07:25.380
GWARGH!

07:26.670 --> 07:28.260
Maname-SAN?

07:32.260 --> 07:34.350
WASSHOI!

07:34.350 --> 07:37.140
A voice from the depths of hell resounds high into the heavens.

07:37.430 --> 07:38.520
NINJA...?

07:38.520 --> 07:39.930
A NINJA?! Why?!

07:40.230 --> 07:42.730
Your MATSURI is over. Begone.

07:45.900 --> 07:46.980
You too.

07:47.320 --> 07:48.820
R-Retreat!

07:49.990 --> 07:51.360
Withdraw!

07:51.990 --> 07:53.040
Move!

07:54.870 --> 07:59.660
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE,
NINJA Slayer-SAN! I am JÖTTUN!

07:54.870 --> 07:59.660
NOTE: A JÖTTUN is an EOTEN gone COMMIE.

08:00.290 --> 08:03.170
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE, JÖTTUN-SAN.

08:03.170 --> 08:05.040
I am NINJA Slayer.

08:05.330 --> 08:09.550
My comrade Flickshot died before he could see the dawn of the revolution.

08:09.550 --> 08:15.340
But his revolutionary ideals have become one with the collective will of IKKI UCHIKOWASHI,

08:15.340 --> 08:16.970
and will live forever!

08:18.720 --> 08:19.220
YEEART!

08:22.480 --> 08:24.440
You cannot win.

08:24.440 --> 08:27.690
This is my FŪRIN KAZAN,
the OBORO JITSU!

08:28.020 --> 08:30.860
This fog shall be your requiem!

08:31.360 --> 08:33.110
Where are you, Yukano?

08:35.240 --> 08:38.240
Why is this happening? A NINJA? Why?!

08:38.240 --> 08:39.580
Why is this...

08:51.130 --> 08:52.590
Wait!

08:52.590 --> 08:55.800
You're Maname-SAN, right? It's me! Naraki!

08:55.800 --> 08:59.560
You killed that student so the protest would become a riot.

08:59.560 --> 09:02.310
One of our war's necessary sacrifices.

09:02.310 --> 09:04.060
That can't be—

09:04.060 --> 09:08.860
You were the one who told me that our war wasn't about terrorism.

09:08.860 --> 09:10.570
Am I a criminal now?

09:10.570 --> 09:13.240
What's going on here?

09:14.860 --> 09:19.370
You brought me here... No, there must be others as well.

09:19.370 --> 09:22.120
You brought us here to make us fight!

09:22.120 --> 09:23.790
You can't do this!

09:23.790 --> 09:27.250
You stand upon a battlefield,
but without the needed resolve.

09:27.250 --> 09:29.250
That is not your fault.

09:29.960 --> 09:34.340
Citizens like you must be mobilized as a foundation of the revolution.

09:34.340 --> 09:35.760
Be proud.

09:36.510 --> 09:38.510
And my name isn't Maname.

09:38.510 --> 09:40.350
My name is AMNESIA.

09:52.020 --> 09:53.030
YEEART!

09:58.700 --> 09:59.620
Let me go!

09:59.870 --> 10:00.660
Yukano!

10:00.660 --> 10:01.530
Don't call me that!

10:01.530 --> 10:03.100
I'm AMNESIA!

10:03.100 --> 10:04.870
An IKKI UCHIKOWASHI warrior!

10:04.870 --> 10:08.170
How dare you show yourself here!

10:08.170 --> 10:10.420
You counterrevolutionary traitor!

10:10.420 --> 10:14.000
I was asked by Dragon-SENSEI to take care of you!

10:14.000 --> 10:15.260
By your own grandfather!

10:15.260 --> 10:17.800
Don't say that name! I hate it!

10:18.050 --> 10:22.140
You hurt the citizens, and conspire with NINJA to destroy the city.

10:22.140 --> 10:24.270
Is that how you want to live?

10:24.270 --> 10:26.020
Violence is a necessary evil.

10:26.020 --> 10:29.900
To build a better world,
the citizens must die happily.

10:29.900 --> 10:32.440
That ideology makes me sick to my stomach.

10:32.440 --> 10:34.610
Did you learn that from BUSTER Tetsuo?

10:34.900 --> 10:39.780
Comrade Tetsuo is every warrior within IKKI UCHIKOWASHI!

10:43.330 --> 10:44.330
Yukano!

10:44.330 --> 10:46.410
Are you sure this is what you want to do?

10:47.290 --> 10:50.290
Enough! I am AMNESIA!

10:50.540 --> 10:51.960
That's enough!

10:51.960 --> 10:54.300
Give it up already, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:54.300 --> 10:56.010
Your ugly obsession makes me want to sp—

10:56.010 --> 10:56.760
Silence!

10:57.130 --> 10:58.340
YEEART!

10:58.340 --> 10:59.300
GWAAARGGHH!

10:59.300 --> 11:00.720
SAYŌNARA!

11:05.140 --> 11:07.020
Curse you, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

11:07.020 --> 11:08.730
How dare you kill Comrade JÖTTUN!

11:08.730 --> 11:11.810
It's useless. Your arrows cannot kill me.

11:14.110 --> 11:16.320
Begone, AMNESIA-SAN.

11:16.320 --> 11:19.860
You and IKKI UCHIKOWASHI are my enemies!

11:19.860 --> 11:21.410
Remove yourself from my presence.

11:41.430 --> 11:43.800
NINJA Slayer did not follow.

11:43.800 --> 11:48.720
The things he did here and the conclusions he reached were surely not the right ones.

11:49.270 --> 11:53.810
But he had no better answer.

11:55.810 --> 11:58.070
Welcome...

11:58.360 --> 11:59.780
Oh, SEMPAI.

11:59.780 --> 12:01.240
I brought a friend.

12:02.110 --> 12:03.160
Good work.

12:04.200 --> 12:08.160
Should I take a JUTTE or a BŌ or something?

12:08.160 --> 12:09.700
Are you stupid?

12:09.700 --> 12:13.330
Now, now. A lot of people think that.

12:13.330 --> 12:14.920
But that won't do.

12:14.920 --> 12:16.840
Our war isn't about terrorism.

12:16.840 --> 12:21.670
I don't think we should seek shortcuts like violence or agitation.

12:21.920 --> 12:25.010
Even if it takes time, we should think about the real answer.

12:25.260 --> 12:26.510
That's right.

12:26.850 --> 12:28.100
Yeah.

12:29.350 --> 12:30.140
Okay.

12:30.140 --> 12:31.270
See you later.

12:34.770 --> 12:38.820
I'm sure this is it, Maname-SAN.
